Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue.** The parser reads dates month first, and our tenants write the day
first. The fix is queued.

<Callout>
Split: two causes. #4471 is the parser's; the hint reports have their own ticket.
</Callout>

**Update 2026-11-12:** by the desk's own cause rule, #4471 holds two causes, not one. Its own cause is
the parser; 33 hint reports were merged in by mistake and now have
[issue #4](https://github.com/wojciechbednarz/mega-s01e03-kb/issues/4) — see [#4471 split](/kb/incidents/4471-split).

